        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-30T21:49:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>The stuff below is all for Steam. &nbsp;I haven't messed with achievements much yet on Android.</strong></p><p>First off, it would be awesome if there was some way to see how you're doing on the various achievements. &nbsp;In particular, the 100 across all types, it would be really nice to know the types I'm lacking (been having CR pick infernal every time for crossbow, since I assume that's probably lacking).</p><p>Secondly, I'm curious if the achievement for Settling Scores is working or not. &nbsp;As I was doing the \"Hero we need/Hero we deserve\" achievements, each time I would complete one, a little pop-up would appear and say \"1/4\", \"2/4\", etc. &nbsp;However, I've now defeating Blade with Legacy, and Ambuscade with Haka, but no little pop-up. &nbsp;Incidentally, I used Young Legacy and Eternal Haka, so it's possible that it's just not tracking if you use a variant (checking that next).</p><p>If the first part was done, I could more easily verify whether the second isn't working, or just isn't providing a pop-up.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:20.943Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
