        "raw": "<p><strong>The stuff below is all for Steam. &nbsp;I haven&#39;t messed with achievements much yet on Android.</strong></p><p>First off, it would be awesome if there was some way to see how you&#39;re doing on the various achievements. &nbsp;In particular, the 100 across all types, it would be really nice to know the types I&#39;m lacking (been having CR pick infernal every time for crossbow, since I assume that&#39;s probably lacking).</p><p>Secondly, I&#39;m curious if the achievement for Settling Scores is working or not. &nbsp;As I was doing the &quot;Hero we need/Hero we deserve&quot; achievements, each time I would complete one, a little pop-up would appear and say &quot;1/4&quot;, &quot;2/4&quot;, etc. &nbsp;However, I&#39;ve now defeating Blade with Legacy, and Ambuscade with Haka, but no little pop-up. &nbsp;Incidentally, I used Young Legacy and Eternal Haka, so it&#39;s possible that it&#39;s just not tracking if you use a variant (checking that next).</p><p>If the first part was done, I could more easily verify whether the second isn&#39;t working, or just isn&#39;t providing a pop-up.</p>",
